# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Guardians of the Forests — Appendices A-C (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Guardians of the Forests (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Appendix (pp. 138–144)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Appendix A (languages and names), Appendix B (the timeline) and Appendix C (the bibliography),
> verbatim.
> Records: the chapter’s covenants and people in `…-appendices-*.actor`; its records in `…-appendices-*.ttrpg`; sidebars in `…-appendices-sidebars.ttrpg`; its places in `…-setting.setting`.

